---
import ProductCTA from './ProductCTA.astro';
---

<article class="bi-product-card">
  <div>
    <span class="bi-kicker">Currently available</span>
    <h3>Polk County, Florida</h3>
    <p>A short paid evaluation sample packet showing research depth, scoring, methodology, and Polk County as the example.</p>
    <ul class="bi-check-list">
      <li>Short evaluation PDF</li>
      <li>200 Polk records exist in the research database, but are not included</li>
      <li>Research gaps marked honestly</li>
    </ul>
  </div>
  <div class="bi-product-card__offer">
    <p class="bi-price"><strong>$29</strong><span>one-time</span></p>
    <ProductCTA label="Get the $29 Sample Packet" secondaryHref="/business-intelligence/sample" secondaryLabel="View Free Sample" />
    <small>Delivered through Gumroad. No Tool Shed account required.</small>
  </div>
</article>
